@startuml aggregate_boundary
!include ../theme.iuml

title Hranice agregátu: Order vs. Customer

package "Aggregate: Order" as OrderAgg {
  class "<<root>>\nOrder" as OrderRoot {
    +OrderId id
    +CustomerId customerId
    +OrderStatus status
    -int version
    --
    +{static} place(id, customerId)
    +addItem(productId, quantity, unitPrice)
    +confirm()
    +markPaid()
    +ship(shipmentId)
    +cancel(reason, when)
    +totalAmount(): Money
  }

  class "<<entity>>\nOrderItem" as OrderItem {
    -?int id (jen DB klíč)
    +ProductId productId
    +int quantity
    +Money unitPrice
    --
    +subtotal(): Money
  }

  class "<<value object>>\nMoney" as Money {
    +int amountInCents
    +Currency currency
  }

  OrderRoot *-- OrderItem : obsahuje 0..n\n(od Confirmed 1..n)
  OrderItem *-- Money : má
}

package "Aggregate: Customer" as CustomerAgg {
  class "<<root>>\nCustomer" as CustomerRoot {
    +CustomerId id
    +Email email
  }
}

OrderRoot ..> CustomerRoot : odkaz pouze\npřes CustomerId\n(NE objektová reference)

note right of OrderAgg
  Transakční hranice =
  hranice agregátu.
  Handler ukládá jen
  tento agregát; flush()
  to sám nevynutí.
end note

note bottom of CustomerAgg
  Změna v Customer
  je oddělená transakce
  (eventual consistency
  přes doménový event).
end note

@enduml
